WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:08.920
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.560 --> 01:37.040
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL

01:37.120 --> 01:38.920
‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:42.000 --> 01:45.600
XUANSHI PALACE

01:49.760 --> 01:50.800
Wei Rao,

01:54.280 --> 01:55.400
before we see the Emperor,

01:57.360 --> 01:58.600
do you have anything to tell me?

02:06.560 --> 02:07.600
I…

02:11.560 --> 02:15.720
Summoning the Heir to the Duke of Ying
and his wife, Lady Wei.

02:19.000 --> 02:20.840
What do you want to hear from me, My Lord?

02:26.400 --> 02:29.160
Once we're inside the hall,
you don't need to speak.

02:30.320 --> 02:31.160
I will handle it.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.960
XUANSHI PALACE

02:54.240 --> 02:57.120
Lu Zhuo pays his respects to Your Majesty.

02:59.720 --> 03:01.360
All right. Not a formal session today.

03:01.960 --> 03:04.160
There's no need for such formalities.

03:04.240 --> 03:05.080
You may rise.

03:10.400 --> 03:11.320
Lu Zhuo,

03:12.000 --> 03:13.840
I invited you both here today.

03:13.920 --> 03:15.760
I meant to act as a peacemaker

03:15.840 --> 03:20.040
to resolve the grudge and end
the hostility among your three families.

03:20.840 --> 03:22.680
Prince Rong is His Majesty's brother.

03:23.600 --> 03:25.760
The Lu and Han families
are pillars of the court.

03:26.400 --> 03:29.120
For the three families to
harbor animosity and argue endlessly,

03:29.200 --> 03:31.680
how is that proper conduct for subjects?

03:32.520 --> 03:35.480
This must all be a misunderstanding.

03:35.560 --> 03:37.760
I would also like to ask Prince Rong

03:39.080 --> 03:40.520
what kind of misunderstanding it was

03:40.600 --> 03:43.040
that made you disregard
etiquette and propriety

03:43.120 --> 03:44.760
to openly intrude
into my ancestral temple.

03:49.520 --> 03:50.600
I am guilty.

03:50.680 --> 03:52.000
The servant, Anfu,

03:52.080 --> 03:54.040
accused them of
hiding imperial ritual vessels.

03:54.640 --> 03:55.920
I dare not to act on my own,

03:56.000 --> 03:57.760
so I immediately
reported it to Prince Rong.

03:57.840 --> 04:00.160
His Highness has a fiery temper.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.760
How can he tolerate such overstepping?

04:02.640 --> 04:04.440
He rushed straight to
confront the Lu family.

04:04.520 --> 04:06.880
Who would have thought?
It was actually that servant,

04:06.960 --> 04:08.720
mistreated by his masters,

04:09.760 --> 04:12.000
and made up a huge lie
to frame the Lu family.

04:12.760 --> 04:15.080
All of this had
nothing to do with Prince Rong.

04:15.160 --> 04:17.040
It was all my fault. I misjudged

04:17.120 --> 04:18.600
and trusted the wrong man.

04:18.680 --> 04:23.480
I deserve death. A thousand deaths.

04:24.080 --> 04:26.600
To think that Anfu, an illiterate servant,

04:27.120 --> 04:28.920
actually knew how to
identify imperial vessels.

04:29.880 --> 04:31.640
This is truly an extraordinary tale.

04:33.440 --> 04:36.880
Lord Lu is right to lecture me.
It was all my fault.

04:37.720 --> 04:40.000
Your Majesty, in my view,

04:40.080 --> 04:42.160
we must capture Anfu
and torture him severely.

04:42.760 --> 04:45.120
I doubt he'll keep quiet about
who's behind it.

04:45.200 --> 04:47.360
Why pretend, Lord Han?

04:48.160 --> 04:50.320
Don't you know
Anfu was thrown into the imperial prison

04:51.480 --> 04:53.320
and then dropped dead right there?

04:54.520 --> 04:55.360
He is dead?

04:56.640 --> 04:59.000
This is clearly silencing a witness.

05:00.880 --> 05:02.080
Your Majesty,

05:02.160 --> 05:04.400
I request that the Commandant's Office
look into this case.

05:04.920 --> 05:09.200
So the truth can come to light soon
and clear the name of loyal subjects.

05:09.800 --> 05:13.120
Over a hundred people in the Lu family,
they can all testify to it.

05:13.960 --> 05:15.280
You intruded into my ancestral temple,

05:15.360 --> 05:17.120
destroyed our spirit tablets,
and insulted our ancestors.

05:17.800 --> 05:19.120
Which of these wronged you?

05:20.080 --> 05:22.400
How dare you shamelessly
claim your name to be cleared?

05:22.480 --> 05:25.000
Lord Lu, it was all because I was foolish

05:25.080 --> 05:26.520
and deceived by others.

05:28.080 --> 05:29.600
Punish me however you like,

05:31.160 --> 05:32.200
it's your call.

05:33.320 --> 05:34.200
All right.

05:35.040 --> 05:38.080
There are no witnesses,
only verbal claims.

05:39.160 --> 05:41.200
Whose side do you expect me to believe?

05:42.320 --> 05:45.360
In this hall today,
there is more than one victim.

05:46.680 --> 05:48.960
Lady Wei, you were also wronged.

05:49.040 --> 05:51.600
I can have Han family compensate you.

05:52.640 --> 05:53.880
So, Your Majesty,

05:54.800 --> 05:56.600
are you shielding
Prince Rong and Han Liao?

05:57.720 --> 05:58.560
Insolence!

05:59.400 --> 06:00.400
Lu Zhuo,

06:01.040 --> 06:03.440
His Majesty knows
your grandfather is stubborn

06:03.520 --> 06:05.040
and inflexible,

06:05.120 --> 06:06.960
which is why he asked
you here to make peace.

06:07.040 --> 06:10.840
So, you also want to go
against His Majesty's kindness?

06:11.520 --> 06:13.280
I have decided on the compensation.

06:14.680 --> 06:15.640
I only ask for Your Majesty's approval.

06:16.400 --> 06:17.240
Speak.

06:19.240 --> 06:22.840
I beg Your Majesty to grant permission
to chop off Prince Rong's left foot

06:24.400 --> 06:27.080
and both of Lord Han's feet
as compensation.

06:33.800 --> 06:39.040
ZHAOYANG PALACE

06:42.800 --> 06:45.560
Your Ladyship, are you worried that
you idea to His Majesty won't work?

06:47.280 --> 06:49.480
The Empress Dowager did
her best to protect Prince Rong.

06:49.560 --> 06:51.240
His Majesty didn't
want to break with his mother

06:51.320 --> 06:54.200
and bear the name of an unfilial son,
so he could only release Prince Rong.

06:54.800 --> 06:57.080
Besides, everything is
over with the witness dead.

06:57.600 --> 06:59.760
No matter how
dissatisfied the Lu family is,

06:59.840 --> 07:01.440
they cannot oppose the Empress Dowager.

07:02.120 --> 07:04.240
Then you must be worried
about Yinggu, who left the palace.

07:06.120 --> 07:08.280
Yinggu is just visiting
my mother at Xianzhuang.

07:08.360 --> 07:09.880
Why would I worry about her?

07:10.840 --> 07:12.600
Stop being cheeky here.

07:12.680 --> 07:14.840
Hurry to Xuanshi Palace
and see if Rao has arrived.

07:15.440 --> 07:16.800
Yes, I'm going now.

07:16.880 --> 07:18.520
Go quickly.

07:19.320 --> 07:22.560
ZHAOYANG PALACE

07:24.560 --> 07:26.040
You vicious woman,

07:26.120 --> 07:28.400
-how dare you!
-Shut up.

07:29.280 --> 07:33.600
Let her talk. I want to hear it.
I have pardoned them.

07:34.320 --> 07:37.320
What crime are you charging them with
to cut off their feet?

07:38.680 --> 07:39.720
Wei Rao.

07:44.720 --> 07:45.560
Your Majesty,

07:46.240 --> 07:47.720
The witness, Anfu, is dead,

07:48.440 --> 07:50.320
making it hard to prove
Han's false accusation.

07:51.000 --> 07:53.280
But the innocent woman
abducted by Lord Han is still alive

07:53.800 --> 07:55.240
and can testify at any time.

07:56.640 --> 07:58.160
Lord Han's violated two laws.

07:58.960 --> 08:01.760
One, abetting others
in the commission of a crime.

08:01.840 --> 08:05.080
He forcibly abducted a commoner woman
and schemed to do harm.

08:05.160 --> 08:08.120
Two, the guilty injuring the innocent.

08:08.200 --> 08:10.320
The Lu family tried to save her
and got beaten instead.

08:10.400 --> 08:12.800
For the Han family,
this doubles the offense.

08:13.400 --> 08:15.360
But I was the one got beaten and injured.

08:15.440 --> 08:16.640
By our laws,

08:17.440 --> 08:19.080
anyone who abducts a woman without cause

08:19.800 --> 08:23.680
her rescuer can kill you on the spot
with impunity.

08:24.560 --> 08:25.400
Your Majesty!

08:25.480 --> 08:29.120
If a commoner abducts a woman,
a left foot shall be cut off.

08:29.200 --> 08:32.760
For an official, that makes it worse,
and both his feet get cut off.

08:34.240 --> 08:36.760
Accomplices share
the same guilt as the abductor.

08:37.280 --> 08:38.720
Lord Han bore full responsibility.

08:38.799 --> 08:41.039
Prince Rong was
deceived and acted as an accomplice.

08:41.120 --> 08:42.520
The mastermind loses both feet,

08:43.559 --> 08:46.400
and the accomplice loses his left foot.
This is already lenient treatment.

08:47.560 --> 08:50.200
When a prince breaks the law,
he is as guilty as a commoner.

08:50.880 --> 08:54.480
If Your Majesty spares them today,
it tells the people of the realm that

08:54.560 --> 08:55.520
abducting is guiltless,

08:56.520 --> 08:58.400
and flouting the law carries no fault.

08:58.480 --> 09:00.960
If a royal brother and your favorite
subject defy the law,

09:01.040 --> 09:04.560
who in the realm will obey
the laws of the state

09:04.640 --> 09:06.000
and follow
Your Majesty's commands in the future?

09:06.080 --> 09:08.520
Shut up! I'll chop you down.

09:09.800 --> 09:10.720
You…

09:13.600 --> 09:14.600
Your Majesty, forgive me.

09:14.680 --> 09:16.720
It is not the Lu family
demanding these three feet.

09:17.720 --> 09:19.400
It is the state's law that demands them.

09:19.920 --> 09:22.720
To uphold Your Majesty's
authority and imperial dignity,

09:23.240 --> 09:24.320
it has to be done.

09:27.680 --> 09:30.480
Well done. Well said.

09:31.560 --> 09:32.720
Though sharp-tongued,

09:33.320 --> 09:35.040
what you say is well-reasoned.

09:37.000 --> 09:39.560
However, my word is final,
and I have promised the Empress Dowager

09:40.440 --> 09:41.880
that I will pardon them.

09:41.960 --> 09:44.040
What do you propose, then?

09:45.320 --> 09:47.200
Then, please grant permission,
Your Majesty,

09:47.720 --> 09:51.440
allowing Prince Rong and the Han family
redeem their crimes with gold.

09:51.520 --> 09:53.240
-How arrogant!
-Granted.

09:54.120 --> 09:55.240
What?

09:56.440 --> 09:58.200
Do you wish to lose
your left foot instead?

10:01.520 --> 10:02.640
I believe

10:03.160 --> 10:05.640
Prince Rong's new estate
in the east of the city

10:05.720 --> 10:07.520
-will suffice.
-You!

10:15.240 --> 10:16.080
Take it.

10:17.120 --> 10:18.200
Lord Han.

10:20.160 --> 10:21.480
I am willing to offer 20,000 gold.

10:22.320 --> 10:24.760
I hear the Han family
has 500 mu of fertile land

10:24.840 --> 10:26.440
at the foot of Mount Yaowang.

10:29.200 --> 10:30.360
Only enough for his left foot.

10:32.880 --> 10:35.640
Then I ask Your Majesty
to chop off Lord Han's right foot instead.

10:37.200 --> 10:39.840
The mountain estate and
300 servants included,

10:40.440 --> 10:42.360
all yours, your Ladyship.

10:43.240 --> 10:47.280
If only you would show mercy
and spare my right foot.

10:49.000 --> 10:51.080
Death may be spared,
yet punishment cannot be evaded.

10:52.120 --> 10:54.920
Your Majesty, please bear witness for me.
Don't let them deny it.

10:55.880 --> 10:58.280
Your gold and land
may have saved your feet

10:58.800 --> 11:01.640
but serving a month of penal labor
is still unavoidable.

11:01.720 --> 11:04.160
-You…
-Fine.

11:04.760 --> 11:07.160
We shall this day bear witness
on behalf of all three families.

11:07.960 --> 11:10.000
Prince Rong shall
forfeit one year of stipend.

11:10.880 --> 11:13.320
Han Liao shall serve
one month of hard labor.

11:13.920 --> 11:16.360
If anyone break or deny it,

11:16.440 --> 11:19.280
I will chop off a left foot from them.

11:20.880 --> 11:22.160
All clear now?

11:24.200 --> 11:25.920
-Yes.
-Yes.

11:37.360 --> 11:40.640
XUANSHI PALACE

11:40.720 --> 11:42.160
This is my first time seeing

11:42.680 --> 11:44.640
anyone dare to bargain
in the Xuanshi Palace.

11:45.240 --> 11:47.760
If His Majesty simply
wanted to favor Prince Rong,

11:48.280 --> 11:51.160
he could have just issued an edict.
Why ask us to come here?

11:52.320 --> 11:55.640
He invited you, meaning
he wants a justice for the Lu family.

11:56.360 --> 11:59.120
If justice cannot be settled with lives,

12:00.440 --> 12:02.160
then it shall be compensated with wealth.

12:02.800 --> 12:04.720
Either way, we can't suffer for nothing.

12:04.800 --> 12:06.800
As for whether to show mercy,

12:08.000 --> 12:10.000
His Majesty only said no sentence today,

12:10.600 --> 12:14.440
not that the Lu family
can't take revenge in the future.

12:15.160 --> 12:18.800
Grandfather would certainly
not accept such worldly possessions.

12:20.320 --> 12:22.160
Lu as the main victim does not want them.

12:22.680 --> 12:24.240
I, as the minor victim, certainly do.

12:24.320 --> 12:27.240
I don't have your family's
wealth and power.

12:28.200 --> 12:29.800
Demanding them for yourself, huh?

12:30.920 --> 12:32.760
No wonder you haggled over every bit.

12:33.640 --> 12:34.760
You really are…

12:35.480 --> 12:37.360
Greetings, Lord Lu and Lady Lu.

12:37.440 --> 12:40.000
My mistress invites
you for a conversation, Lady Lu.

12:40.800 --> 12:42.200
May I ask who your mistress is?

12:42.720 --> 12:44.720
My mistress is Lady Li of Zhaoyang Palace.

12:54.840 --> 12:56.520
You haven't eaten anything all day,

12:57.680 --> 12:59.280
and waited in full dress for two hours

13:00.280 --> 13:01.800
Your stomach ailment has recurred.

13:05.800 --> 13:07.320
My wife is feeling unwell.

13:07.400 --> 13:08.480
I'm afraid she might embarrass herself
in front of your Ladyship.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.200
We must come pay our respects another day.

13:10.280 --> 13:11.680
Please ask Lady Li to forgive us.

13:13.840 --> 13:15.240
Rao.

13:17.880 --> 13:18.920
Rao.

13:40.800 --> 13:41.880
Rao.

13:43.680 --> 13:44.560
Lord Lu.

13:45.480 --> 13:46.480
Pardon my intrusion.

13:49.680 --> 13:50.680
Is she sick?

13:51.280 --> 13:53.200
How can she bear
the jolt of a carriage while ill?

13:53.280 --> 13:55.440
Bring her to my palace at once,
and ask for an imperial physician.

13:56.280 --> 13:57.440
This is the imperial palace,

13:58.320 --> 14:00.520
so I dare not breach etiquette.
Please return, Your Ladyship.

14:01.240 --> 14:03.760
Mother and daughter have been
separated for years with few reunions.

14:04.280 --> 14:06.520
A sudden meeting
inevitably causes distress.

14:07.280 --> 14:08.520
Please do not blame her, Lady Li.

14:08.600 --> 14:10.880
Too many ears here. Not the place to talk.

14:11.680 --> 14:13.160
If your Ladyship wishes to meet,

14:13.240 --> 14:14.360
please find another time.

14:15.240 --> 14:16.760
I will take Rao back home first.

14:16.840 --> 14:19.200
-I won't allow it.
-Please wait, Lord Lu.

14:24.840 --> 14:27.880
My Lord, His Majesty's
got a unfinished weiqi game.

14:27.960 --> 14:29.160
He asked you back to the palace.

14:29.840 --> 14:31.920
Lady Lu may rest
in Zhaoyang Palace for now.

14:32.000 --> 14:33.920
My wife's old illness
has suddenly flared up.

14:35.120 --> 14:36.200
I will see His Majesty
right after I take her home.

14:37.240 --> 14:38.680
Apologize to His Majesty on my behalf.

14:38.760 --> 14:41.800
Lady Lu is ill. We've got plenty of
imperial physicians here.

14:41.880 --> 14:44.520
How can His Majesty
be made to wait for a subject?

14:44.600 --> 14:46.040
Lu Zhuo,

14:47.560 --> 14:51.400
you repeatedly stop us from being close.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.840
What are your intentions?

14:55.520 --> 14:56.480
Pay no attention.

14:56.560 --> 15:00.520
Lord Lu, you must not.
You must not defy an imperial decree.

15:06.400 --> 15:07.280
Put me down.

15:08.280 --> 15:09.280
Wei Rao.

15:22.800 --> 15:24.120
There is no need, Lady Li.

15:25.480 --> 15:27.880
His Majesty must asked for you
with something important.

15:28.480 --> 15:30.120
Do not delay your work for me.

15:32.040 --> 15:33.560
I will wait for you at Zhaoyang Palace.

15:34.600 --> 15:35.520
Alright.

15:36.440 --> 15:39.080
I will pick you up right after I finish.

15:42.240 --> 15:43.880
Go on and tend to your affairs.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.760
I will take good care of Rao.

15:45.840 --> 15:49.920
Lady Li, palace rules state that
family visits are limited to a quarter.

15:50.000 --> 15:51.360
We must not delay.

15:51.440 --> 15:53.480
Alright, spare me the nagging.

15:54.000 --> 15:56.320
Someone, bring my palanquin.

15:57.000 --> 15:59.440
Lady Lu will ride with me.

15:59.520 --> 16:00.680
Let's go.

16:05.920 --> 16:07.120
Lord Lu,

16:08.760 --> 16:09.800
this way, please.

16:22.960 --> 16:24.880
THE HOUR OF WEI

16:30.800 --> 16:31.880
Your Ladyship,

16:31.960 --> 16:33.200
this stomach ailment
is a chronic condition

16:33.280 --> 16:34.360
caused by years of irregular eating

16:34.960 --> 16:38.560
and suppressed emotions.
It cannot be cured overnight.

16:38.640 --> 16:40.360
We must use acupuncture

16:40.440 --> 16:42.520
along with carefully
prepared medicinal food.

16:42.600 --> 16:45.560
To cure this illness,
we should go slowly rather than rush.

16:46.240 --> 16:47.320
Go write the prescription.

16:48.000 --> 16:48.960
Yes.

16:53.000 --> 16:54.280
Not my place to sit here.

16:59.400 --> 17:01.160
Darned the Earl of Cheng'an's residence.

17:01.240 --> 17:03.400
How did they take care of you

17:04.319 --> 17:06.520
to let you suffer from such an illness?

17:07.480 --> 17:10.040
Was Old Madam Wei bad to you?

17:11.160 --> 17:13.119
Or did Lady Guo dare to treat you harshly?

17:14.280 --> 17:16.520
Or was it that useless uncle of yours?

17:16.599 --> 17:18.240
No matter who it was,

17:20.079 --> 17:21.319
Mother will settle this for you.

17:21.920 --> 17:25.920
Grandmother, Uncle, and Aunt
were all very good to me.

17:49.440 --> 17:50.280
Rao,

17:51.080 --> 17:51.920
turn around.

17:53.960 --> 17:55.400
Let me look at you.

18:14.080 --> 18:15.680
Good to you?

18:17.320 --> 18:20.120
If they were good to you,
would you be so skinny?

18:20.960 --> 18:23.360
Would they make you marry
a dying man for luck?

18:23.880 --> 18:25.240
Do not lie to me.

18:26.760 --> 18:29.880
I broke my way out
of the suffocating mansion.

18:30.520 --> 18:33.240
Those people speak sweet words,

18:33.920 --> 18:37.280
but they are full of hypocrisy
and schemes.

18:39.680 --> 18:40.920
Rao,

18:41.520 --> 18:43.000
your face is so pale.

18:44.200 --> 18:46.760
Your hands are so cold. Are you trembling?

18:57.200 --> 18:58.200
Rao,

18:59.040 --> 19:02.640
I know you hate me, blame me

19:02.720 --> 19:04.960
that you don't want to see me. I know.

19:07.360 --> 19:08.400
But…

19:10.560 --> 19:13.120
I miss you every day.

19:14.320 --> 19:16.400
I have never
forgotten you for a single day.

19:18.360 --> 19:19.400
My daughter…

19:21.520 --> 19:23.320
You are my daughter.

19:30.320 --> 19:32.960
Rao, do not cry. Do not cry.

19:33.680 --> 19:34.800
It is all my fault.

19:34.880 --> 19:37.400
How did I end up making you cry?

19:38.720 --> 19:42.200
You were still young when I left,
so you do not remember me.

19:44.720 --> 19:46.360
But every time your grandmother

19:47.400 --> 19:49.280
took you to
the Eldest Princess's Residence,

19:52.240 --> 19:54.280
I would go and
secretly take a look at you.

19:55.760 --> 19:59.560
I know you, my daughter, is a real beauty.

20:00.320 --> 20:02.520
I knew you were betrothed to Lu Zhuo.

20:03.120 --> 20:04.920
What I did not know

20:06.000 --> 20:07.960
was that the Empress Dowager, the hag,

20:09.080 --> 20:11.160
would make you
marry him to ward off bad luck.

20:11.240 --> 20:14.240
By the time I found out about all this,
it was already too late.

20:14.320 --> 20:15.520
Lady Li.

20:15.600 --> 20:18.480
She is just a narrow-minded hag.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.240
If she hadn't kept interfering

20:20.840 --> 20:22.280
how could we be seperated

20:22.360 --> 20:25.560
for so many years
and hardly ever seen each other?

20:26.840 --> 20:28.480
She dislikes the Zhou family.

20:29.000 --> 20:30.600
How could she treat you well?

20:32.320 --> 20:35.800
Thankfully, Lu Zhuo
was not destined for a short life.

20:37.320 --> 20:38.600
Otherwise,

20:38.680 --> 20:41.320
you would have become
a widow right after getting married,

20:42.520 --> 20:44.560
following right in my footsteps.

20:48.040 --> 20:48.880
Aman,

20:49.480 --> 20:51.280
Rao was terrified and
hasn't eaten anything

20:51.360 --> 20:52.960
which triggered her illness.

20:53.760 --> 20:56.000
Go and prepare some pastries.

20:56.080 --> 20:57.400
Yes.

21:01.640 --> 21:04.480
Just have a little bit with me, alright?

21:08.360 --> 21:11.320
ZHAOYANG PALACE

21:23.000 --> 21:23.840
Here.

21:40.240 --> 21:41.240
It is not to your taste?

21:44.280 --> 21:46.960
Not as delicious as
the ones at Wei Residence?

21:48.880 --> 21:50.480
If you do not like it, leave it here.

21:51.080 --> 21:52.440
I will have them make it again.

21:53.040 --> 21:55.600
Your Ladyship,
it is almost the end for the visit.

22:00.520 --> 22:02.880
Aman, go fetch my things.

22:11.840 --> 22:12.760
Look,

22:12.840 --> 22:15.600
these are all my fine treasures. Look.

22:15.680 --> 22:18.360
Look at these. Which one do you like?

22:21.560 --> 22:22.680
Is this one pretty?

22:31.560 --> 22:32.400
No.

22:40.000 --> 22:41.120
Do not move.

22:44.320 --> 22:45.560
It looks beautiful.

22:46.920 --> 22:50.680
Not just these. There are also gold and
jade treasures in the storeroom.

22:51.200 --> 22:52.560
I'm leaving all of them for you.

22:55.440 --> 22:56.280
Back then,

22:57.160 --> 22:59.080
if he hadn't promised

22:59.760 --> 23:02.640
that he would treat you well

23:03.440 --> 23:05.960
and stand up for you
when your father is gone,

23:07.120 --> 23:09.040
who would care to
live in this golden cage,

23:10.680 --> 23:13.840
controlled by others all day long.
Nowhere to be free.

23:14.560 --> 23:15.520
All these things

23:16.520 --> 23:19.040
-should be his compensation to you.
-Your Ladyship, mind your words.

23:22.680 --> 23:25.120
Is calling me your Mother too much to ask?

23:34.960 --> 23:36.960
Your Ladyship, the time has come.

23:37.040 --> 23:39.280
It is time to see her out of the palace.

23:42.560 --> 23:45.240
-Rao,
-I am grateful for your immense kindness.

23:45.320 --> 23:48.320
I shall take my leave now.
Please take care of yourself.

23:49.200 --> 23:50.120
Rao.

23:51.920 --> 23:53.000
Rao.

23:54.880 --> 23:57.640
-Rao!
-Your Ladyship, the palace has its rules.

23:57.720 --> 23:59.400
Any further delay
will disturb the Empress Dowager.

23:59.480 --> 24:01.280
That would also be bad for Lady Lu.

24:01.360 --> 24:02.880
Please don't make things difficult for me.

24:02.960 --> 24:03.840
Get out!

24:05.800 --> 24:06.840
Rao.

24:07.640 --> 24:09.080
Rao.

24:13.960 --> 24:15.320
ZHAOYANG PALACE

24:54.440 --> 24:57.560
Look at you.
You longed so much to see your daughter,

24:58.240 --> 25:00.320
yet now that you have,
are you still not happy?

25:00.840 --> 25:03.400
Go away! I never want to see you again.

25:03.480 --> 25:04.680
How impudent!

25:04.760 --> 25:07.040
Here. Strike me.

25:07.120 --> 25:08.000
Once I am dead,

25:09.120 --> 25:11.200
have your gray-haired
wet nurse come into the palace,

25:12.040 --> 25:14.360
carry me out rolling in a tattered mat,
then bury me.

25:15.840 --> 25:18.600
That would end
our ill-fated bond in this life.

25:20.200 --> 25:21.400
In the next life,

25:21.920 --> 25:24.200
even if I were born an animal,

25:24.280 --> 25:26.520
I would never live in
this golden cage of yours.

25:27.040 --> 25:28.680
I would rather have
thorn hairpins and coarse clothes,

25:29.280 --> 25:30.800
plain tea and simple rice.

25:31.680 --> 25:34.800
It'd be better than being separated
from my child and becoming strangers.

25:34.880 --> 25:36.560
It'd be far better than

25:37.080 --> 25:39.560
the day my beauty fades and love wanes,

25:39.640 --> 25:40.880
and I become tiresome to others.

25:42.400 --> 25:44.480
Come, let me look at you.

25:45.080 --> 25:47.120
You are so beautiful,

25:47.200 --> 25:49.680
so how could you have
lost beauty and faded love?

25:49.760 --> 25:51.280
Nonsense.

25:51.360 --> 25:52.760
Then why do you forbid me
from seeing my daughter?

25:55.640 --> 26:00.400
Fu, she looks too much
like her birth father.

26:00.480 --> 26:03.720
I don't want you dwelling on him.

26:04.440 --> 26:06.000
It just makes you sad for no reason.

26:07.920 --> 26:10.560
She could have been our daughter.

26:10.640 --> 26:11.840
Whose fault is all this?

26:14.960 --> 26:18.080
All right, it is all my fault.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.920
You promised me

26:20.560 --> 26:23.200
that you would treat
my daughter as your own,

26:24.080 --> 26:26.800
that you would make her
the most noble young lady in the world.

26:27.680 --> 26:28.840
Did you keep your promise?

26:32.400 --> 26:35.160
Fu, I asked you to stay away

26:36.280 --> 26:37.480
is to protect her.

26:39.040 --> 26:40.280
Protect her?

26:41.160 --> 26:44.320
You are clearly afraid of
the Empress Dowager in Changle Palace.

26:44.400 --> 26:46.880
Yet you know very well.

26:46.960 --> 26:48.680
Even if you are the Emperor.

26:48.760 --> 26:51.760
Even if you have given
all your filial devotion

26:51.840 --> 26:53.760
and offered
everything eagerly at her feet.

26:54.440 --> 26:57.720
She could only see her eldest son
and Prince Rong in her eyes.

26:57.800 --> 26:59.200
There is no place for you, isn't it?

26:59.280 --> 27:01.520
Zhou Fu, you've gone too far!

27:01.600 --> 27:03.800
Because she is your mother,

27:03.880 --> 27:07.160
I yielded in everything
and backed down at every turn.

27:07.240 --> 27:09.440
But I am a mother, too.

27:10.520 --> 27:11.600
From now on,

27:12.120 --> 27:15.160
I will never let Rao suffer
anything like the lucky marriage.

27:16.400 --> 27:17.880
If anyone dares to bully my daughter,

27:18.480 --> 27:21.520
I will take up swords
and fight the whole world.

27:21.600 --> 27:23.920
I will kill every single one who comes.

27:24.000 --> 27:25.440
Try me if you don't believe it.

27:26.920 --> 27:28.240
Fu, you…

27:42.200 --> 27:43.280
Aunt,

27:43.840 --> 27:46.040
you haven't had
anything to eat or drink all day.

27:46.120 --> 27:47.720
Please have some.

27:54.680 --> 27:58.200
EMPRESS

27:59.920 --> 28:03.560
EMPRESS DOWAGER

28:07.240 --> 28:08.320
Aunt.

28:16.800 --> 28:19.360
Mother, you don't need to worry anymore.

28:19.880 --> 28:21.960
His Majesty has
already pardoned Prince Rong.

28:22.880 --> 28:24.000
What?

28:25.920 --> 28:27.280
His Majesty pardoned Xiao?

28:29.160 --> 28:30.320
That's not right.

28:30.400 --> 28:36.800
Earlier, he was furious
and determined to punish Xiao severely.

28:36.880 --> 28:40.040
How could he suddenly change his mind?

28:40.640 --> 28:44.120
We have Lady Li to thank for that.
Thanks to her persuasive words,

28:44.800 --> 28:46.680
His Majesty changed his mind.

28:47.320 --> 28:51.680
What good intentions
could the scheming temptress have?

28:52.480 --> 28:55.200
It's just to curry favor with you, Aunt.

28:55.800 --> 28:57.680
Who asked you to be out of favor?

28:57.760 --> 29:00.880
Pulling a long face all day,
even I hate looking at it,

29:01.480 --> 29:03.280
let alone the Emperor.

29:03.360 --> 29:08.160
If you won his heart, you should be
the one today to reconcile those brothers

29:09.680 --> 29:11.680
It should have been your duty
as the Empress.

29:11.760 --> 29:16.560
That is only because I come from your clan

29:17.600 --> 29:19.600
and was handpicked by you,

29:20.400 --> 29:22.400
which displeases His Majesty in every way.

29:22.480 --> 29:24.280
Empress, you had better hold your tongue.

29:24.800 --> 29:28.560
Lady Li persuaded His Majesty
to restore fraternal harmony

29:28.640 --> 29:30.040
which is a good thing after all.

29:30.640 --> 29:32.640
Will you be happy if brothers
become sworn enemies

29:32.720 --> 29:34.920
and Mother couldn't eat?

29:38.720 --> 29:40.720
Empress Dowager, His Majesty
sent an edict.

29:48.080 --> 29:51.200
IMPERIAL EDICT

29:53.000 --> 29:54.920
To show special favor to Lady Li,

29:55.000 --> 29:56.320
His Majesty bestows her
the title of Lady of Bright Deportment,

29:56.400 --> 29:58.240
meaning "manifesting virtue".

29:58.320 --> 30:00.280
The title equals that of the Chancellor.

30:00.360 --> 30:02.760
The rank equals to a feudal king,
governing all consorts,

30:02.840 --> 30:04.320
second only to the Empress.

30:04.400 --> 30:05.800
The imperial edict was
delivered to Changle Palace,

30:05.880 --> 30:07.520
and the Empress Dowager approved it.

30:07.600 --> 30:10.000
The formal decree will be issued tomorrow.

30:13.080 --> 30:16.120
Congratulations,
Lady of Bright Deportment.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.520
ZHAOYANG PALACE

30:27.600 --> 30:30.200
Lady Li of Bright Deportment.

30:30.880 --> 30:33.280
Yinggu, you are always the most composed.

30:33.360 --> 30:35.160
What has panicked you so?

30:36.800 --> 30:39.680
Could it be that my mother is unwell?

30:39.760 --> 30:41.120
Lady Li, please dismiss everyone.

30:41.200 --> 30:43.320
I have a matter of
grave importance to report.

30:55.400 --> 30:56.320
Wei Rao.

31:00.480 --> 31:04.280
I haven't thanked you yet, My Lord,
for defending me in the palace.

31:06.520 --> 31:07.600
Grandmother said,

31:08.320 --> 31:11.160
since you fought for all
the compensation from the Hans,

31:11.920 --> 31:13.000
it's all yours to handle.

31:14.360 --> 31:15.440
Understood.

31:17.800 --> 31:19.400
How do you plan to handle those things?

31:22.440 --> 31:25.280
Even if Han Liao
honestly hands over the deeds,

31:26.080 --> 31:27.440
to make them truly belong to you,

31:28.240 --> 31:30.640
you must go to
the relevant offices to re-deed them

31:30.720 --> 31:31.560
and transfer tax obligations.

31:32.160 --> 31:33.400
There are many details involved.

31:34.520 --> 31:36.320
-If you need help…
-No need to trouble you.

31:37.920 --> 31:38.960
I have my own help.

31:47.320 --> 31:49.000
Transferring tax deeds
is quite troublesome.

31:49.080 --> 31:50.800
I wonder who she asked for help.

31:52.640 --> 31:54.160
Her next husband, of course.

31:55.960 --> 31:57.000
Husband…

31:58.920 --> 31:59.920
Husband?

32:07.520 --> 32:09.800
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

32:28.520 --> 32:31.080
-Does it look good?
-It looks really good.

32:31.160 --> 32:33.160
As beautiful as a celestial fairy.

32:34.040 --> 32:36.080
Bitao, what do you think?

32:36.760 --> 32:38.720
The finest silk in the world

32:39.240 --> 32:43.880
and the most luxurious jewels
cannot compare to your radiance.

32:44.600 --> 32:49.120
In my heart,
even in coarse linen without adornment,

32:49.640 --> 32:52.560
you are still you,
as grand as ever, My Lady.

33:06.000 --> 33:07.000
Let's go.

33:17.560 --> 33:18.880
I won't need you to follow today.

33:21.560 --> 33:22.640
My Lady…

33:50.320 --> 33:51.280
This way.

34:00.280 --> 34:01.640
Imperial decrees are hard to disobey.

34:01.720 --> 34:05.200
Even someone as noble as Lord Han
has to serve a full month of hard labor.

34:06.160 --> 34:08.320
Doing hard labor by day
and guarding the gate by night.

34:09.000 --> 34:11.040
-Get lost!
-Look.

34:11.960 --> 34:12.880
He's right over there.

34:23.639 --> 34:25.760
You look so miserable, Lord Han.

34:27.840 --> 34:29.520
Isn't this all thanks to you?

34:29.600 --> 34:30.880
Is it?

34:31.840 --> 34:32.960
Not at all.

34:33.800 --> 34:35.239
It's all my own doing.

34:35.320 --> 34:37.040
I can't blame you, Lady Wei Rao.

34:37.120 --> 34:39.239
Who are you to call her Lady Wei Rao?

34:39.320 --> 34:41.480
You call her that and I am not allowed?

34:42.800 --> 34:45.239
I am no friend to Lu Zhuo.

34:46.360 --> 34:47.639
Not my place to call her my buddy's wife.

34:49.400 --> 34:51.080
"Sister-in-law" isn't right either.

34:51.719 --> 34:54.040
Lu Zhuo's out of my league
to be a brother.

34:56.280 --> 34:58.440
Better to call you Lady Wei Rao.

34:58.520 --> 34:59.400
Friendly enough.

35:01.120 --> 35:02.760
You still got the energy to argue, I see.

35:03.280 --> 35:05.440
It seems this work is too easy.

35:05.960 --> 35:07.480
I knew you'd come.

35:08.080 --> 35:10.240
I wouldn't pass up a chance

35:10.760 --> 35:12.360
to kick someone when they're down either.

35:13.640 --> 35:15.280
So I prepared in advance.

35:16.080 --> 35:16.920
Men.

35:25.720 --> 35:27.560
The deeds for 500 mu of good farmland,

35:28.080 --> 35:30.640
for my grand estate
at the foot of Mount Yaowang,

35:30.720 --> 35:32.120
and the indentures for 300 servants.

35:32.800 --> 35:34.000
They are all here.

35:34.080 --> 35:37.040
This is property confiscated
from your family.

35:37.120 --> 35:38.560
Handing it over is only right.

35:39.080 --> 35:39.960
Saves me the trouble.

35:40.040 --> 35:41.520
Higher.

35:42.240 --> 35:44.320
I sincerely gift all of
this to you, Lady Wei Rao.

35:45.360 --> 35:46.880
I've handled all official procedures.

35:47.560 --> 35:48.920
You just need to take ownership.

35:49.000 --> 35:50.160
LAND DEED

35:50.840 --> 35:52.160
Such a grand gesture.

35:53.920 --> 35:56.320
You parted with
your wealth so readily, Lord Han.

35:56.960 --> 35:58.320
Are you asking me for a favor?

36:03.480 --> 36:05.800
Parting with wealth is temporary pain,

36:05.880 --> 36:08.440
unlike this hard labor
that grinds a man down.

36:08.520 --> 36:10.160
After just one day,

36:10.240 --> 36:12.920
my shoulders and back are covered in cuts.

36:14.000 --> 36:16.000
The soles of my feet are raw too.

36:17.840 --> 36:21.360
If I really do this for a month,
I'm afraid I won't be recognizable.

36:21.440 --> 36:26.520
So, I ask that you
be willing to intercede on my behalf.

36:27.640 --> 36:32.200
Just a word. I only need one word
to spare me from this hard labor.

36:33.520 --> 36:35.720
And I will reward you handsomely.

36:35.800 --> 36:37.040
You're dreaming.

36:39.800 --> 36:42.160
What handsome reward?

36:44.320 --> 36:45.160
Please.

36:51.560 --> 36:52.640
This is…

37:03.280 --> 37:06.240
My redemption money.
Spare me from hard labor,

37:07.040 --> 37:08.440
and all this is yours.

37:20.160 --> 37:22.840
All of these…

37:38.280 --> 37:41.960
Only fine jewels like these
are worthy of a beauty like you.

37:43.360 --> 37:46.360
Rest assured, you won't
need to labor or run about.

37:46.440 --> 37:48.560
You just need to pass
a word to Attendant Liu over there.

37:48.640 --> 37:51.640
Say you've forgiven me
and our families have reconciled.

37:51.720 --> 37:52.920
This matter will be settled.

37:53.000 --> 37:55.480
Such flawless pearls.

37:57.200 --> 37:59.000
Such beautiful gold.

38:00.480 --> 38:05.240
How did you know
that my favorite thing in life is gold?

38:07.920 --> 38:08.760
HENGCHENG GATE

38:08.840 --> 38:12.840
Trinkets, small ornaments, come look.

38:14.240 --> 38:15.680
-It's mine!
-Hurry!

38:15.760 --> 38:16.680
You…

38:17.800 --> 38:19.640
Wei Rao, what are you doing?

38:20.240 --> 38:21.360
Give it to me.

38:22.000 --> 38:22.840
Mine.

38:23.600 --> 38:24.680
Give it to me.

38:41.880 --> 38:43.080
What?

38:43.720 --> 38:45.680
Since it's mine,
I can do as I please with it.

38:48.080 --> 38:49.920
Can't bear to part with it, Lord Han?

38:57.200 --> 38:58.240
It's up to you.

39:04.360 --> 39:09.120
-Give it to me.
-It's mine.

39:09.200 --> 39:12.200
A bit of gold and silver
to make a beauty smile.

39:12.280 --> 39:13.200
It's worth it.

39:14.120 --> 39:15.320
As long as you're happy,

39:16.880 --> 39:17.760
throw it.

39:19.600 --> 39:23.120
General Qi, please convert all the gold
and silver in the chest into grain,

39:23.200 --> 39:26.120
send it to the city charity center,
and have them set up porridge stalls.

39:27.480 --> 39:28.560
At your service.

39:34.840 --> 39:36.960
500 mu of good farmland.

39:40.920 --> 39:42.760
Everyone in the capital knows

39:42.840 --> 39:45.000
that the area below
Mount Yaowang was originally a wasteland.

39:45.680 --> 39:48.080
Destitute refugees gathered there,

39:48.800 --> 39:51.800
and they reclaimed fertile fields
on the barren land.

39:51.880 --> 39:55.320
Your family
lent them seeds and farm tools,

39:56.920 --> 39:58.680
but before the wheat could even ripen,

39:58.760 --> 40:01.400
it was all seized by
high-ranking officials and nobles.

40:02.200 --> 40:04.400
The Han family took all the good farmland.

40:04.480 --> 40:05.720
Free men ended up as tenant.

40:06.400 --> 40:08.080
90% of the grain
they worked so hard to farm

40:08.160 --> 40:10.200
had to be handed over to you.

40:13.920 --> 40:17.200
Han family's good farmland?

40:18.560 --> 40:19.640
What a joke.

40:20.560 --> 40:23.560
Do you even know what you are tearing up
and throwing away?

40:23.640 --> 40:26.240
The wealth belongs to you.

40:26.760 --> 40:29.360
Your land and your slaves. All yours.

40:30.240 --> 40:32.720
How could you destroy it yourself?

40:32.800 --> 40:34.840
-You…
-As I said,

40:35.680 --> 40:37.160
all tenant farmers are set free.

40:38.600 --> 40:43.160
Whoever tills the soil and grows the food,
the grain should rightfully be theirs.

40:51.640 --> 40:54.840
Father, I saw a glazed hairpin
yesterday that I really like.

40:54.920 --> 40:56.400
It only cost 1,500 qian.

40:56.480 --> 40:59.560
Alright, whatever my good girl likes,
I will buy it for you.

40:59.640 --> 41:01.280
Father, you are the best.

41:02.040 --> 41:03.120
Yesterday, I washed clothes
at your residence.

41:03.200 --> 41:04.840
My pay was short by one qian.

41:04.920 --> 41:06.280
Please bestow it upon me, Lord.

41:06.360 --> 41:09.400
Nonsense! When did I ever
withhold your pay? Get lost.

41:10.440 --> 41:11.360
It really was short by one qian.

41:11.440 --> 41:13.360
Without money for medicine,
my mother will die.

41:14.240 --> 41:15.120
Drag her away.

41:17.160 --> 41:19.480
Lord. My Lord!

41:19.560 --> 41:20.400
ZHUANG'S HOUSE

41:32.240 --> 41:33.480
You people…

41:33.560 --> 41:36.320
For pearls and fine jade
and lavish enjoyments,

41:36.400 --> 41:38.440
you won't hesitate to spend gold.

41:40.200 --> 41:43.280
Yet before the truly impoverished,

41:43.360 --> 41:45.440
even for what's rightfully theirs,

41:46.560 --> 41:49.920
you can be so stingy.
Not one penny spent, not one inch given.

41:52.520 --> 41:55.560
Even after working day and night,
rushing about in hardship,

41:56.160 --> 41:58.320
they remain destitute,

41:59.760 --> 42:01.440
dying of exhaustion and hunger.

42:04.600 --> 42:06.000
How pitiful.

42:07.040 --> 42:08.840
How ridiculous.

42:12.440 --> 42:14.280
How terrifying.

42:17.760 --> 42:18.920
Off you go!

42:26.320 --> 42:27.280
Something coming down.

42:28.160 --> 42:30.040
-What is this?
-What is it?

42:30.120 --> 42:31.320
This is mine.

42:34.600 --> 42:36.440
Out of the way, it is all mine!

42:37.440 --> 42:38.480
Hurry!

42:38.560 --> 42:42.440
Goddess of mercy! A true saint!

42:45.040 --> 42:47.240
-Stop, that's mine.
-It's mine.

42:47.320 --> 42:49.920
-Let go.
-Don't tear it, it's mine.

42:57.000 --> 42:58.080
What is all this?

43:02.760 --> 43:04.280
You are all free now.

43:11.760 --> 43:13.720
-I got it.
-It's mine.

43:13.800 --> 43:15.320
Just grab it first.

43:16.520 --> 43:19.160
It's all mine. Get out of the way.

43:19.240 --> 43:23.320
-It's all mine.
-It's all mine.

43:23.920 --> 43:25.040
It's a land deed.

43:25.960 --> 43:27.040
She tore the land deed to pieces.

43:31.400 --> 43:34.360
Estates, farmland, pearls, gold, and jade…

43:35.280 --> 43:40.560
She actually gave up things
many could only dream of.

43:42.280 --> 43:43.400
Lunatic.

43:43.480 --> 43:47.080
She is an absolute lunatic.

43:52.000 --> 43:54.880
However, no matter how bold she is,

43:54.960 --> 43:56.160
how crazy she is,

43:57.640 --> 43:59.800
she has reached a dead end today.

44:18.720 --> 44:21.360
-What are you crying for?
-My Lord…

44:22.600 --> 44:25.160
I am asking you. What are you crying for?

44:35.000 --> 44:36.000
Where is her jewelry?

44:36.600 --> 44:40.360
She gave half to me
and took all the rest with her.

44:43.760 --> 44:44.800
What is she doing?

44:47.600 --> 44:48.640
You…

44:48.720 --> 44:50.480
My Lord,
everyone in the capital is talking.

44:50.560 --> 44:51.680
Madam tore up the land deeds
from the Han family

44:51.760 --> 44:53.440
and freed all the tenant farmers.

44:53.520 --> 44:55.120
She sold the estate,
gold, and silver for grain

44:55.200 --> 44:56.640
and gave it all to the refugees.

45:04.360 --> 45:05.600
She's never coming back.

45:08.080 --> 45:08.920
Right?

45:15.080 --> 45:16.160
Wishful thinking.

45:16.840 --> 45:19.200
Zhao Song, where is she?

45:19.280 --> 45:21.280
She should be at the charity centre now.

45:29.400 --> 45:31.800
Prepare the horses.
Let's leave the city now.

45:31.880 --> 45:33.600
My Lord, aren't you
looking for her Ladyship?

45:33.680 --> 45:34.800
Why leave the city?

45:35.480 --> 45:38.000
To bring her back,
we must go to Mount Yaowang.

45:44.840 --> 45:47.000
You should've seen Han Liao's face.

45:47.080 --> 45:48.960
Ripping his heart out wouldn't hurt more.

45:49.040 --> 45:50.000
Can't believe you just did it.

45:50.080 --> 45:53.960
Then again, who wouldn't love wealth,
lands, and slaves?

45:54.480 --> 45:56.560
In this world,
only you could give them up.

45:59.520 --> 46:01.440
Qi Zhongkai, thank you.

46:02.480 --> 46:04.560
No need for thanks
between us. You know that I…

46:08.400 --> 46:09.680
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

46:16.640 --> 46:18.040
The guest I'm waiting for

46:21.560 --> 46:22.400
has arrived.

46:25.320 --> 46:28.520
-Who goes there?
-General, they look like palace guards.

46:31.160 --> 46:33.760
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

46:36.720 --> 46:38.560
My mistress invites you tonight.

46:39.320 --> 46:41.440
Please board the carriage, Lady Lu.

46:57.600 --> 46:59.560
The moment I stepped out of the palace,

47:00.200 --> 47:01.800
I knew this day would come.

47:02.880 --> 47:03.720
General Qi,

47:05.280 --> 47:06.240
thank you for today.

47:07.520 --> 47:08.640
Wei Rao.

47:09.680 --> 47:10.880
I have personal matters to handle.

47:11.560 --> 47:12.880
I would ask the General
not to inquire further.

49:36.880 --> 49:39.560
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
